cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with the accompanying paper."
type: software
title: "Federated Intrusion Detection under Delayed Labels: A Time-Ordered Study on ToN_IoT (code and results)"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Simulation code, configuration files and per-seed result logs accompanying the
  paper "Federated Intrusion Detection under Delayed Labels: A Time-Ordered Study
  on ToN_IoT" (ICSIC 2026). The study evaluates federated intrusion detection on
  the time-ordered ToN_IoT stream with explicit label-release delays,
  test-then-train evaluation and simulated gateway partitioning, over ten random
  seeds with paired statistical tests. Result files and figures are released
  under CC BY 4.0; the ToN_IoT dataset is not redistributed.
authors:
